SUMMARY:ICEF Performing Arts Presents Disney's "DESCENDENTS THE MUSICAL"
LOCATION:The Miracle Theater\, Inglewood
DESCRIPTION:ICEF Performing Arts proudly presents Disneys Descendants: The 
 
Musical at the historic Miracle Theater in Inglewood! Welcome to Auradon\, 
 
where the children of Disneys most notorious villains Maleficent\, the Evil
 
 Queen\, Jafar and Cruella de Vil\, are given an unexpected opportunity to 
 
leave the Isle of the Lost and attend school alongside the children of Disn
 
eys greatest heroes. Filled with high-energy music\, dance\, comedy and fam
 
iliar characters\, Descendants asks a surprisingly meaningful question: Are
 
 young people destined to inherit the choices and expectations of the gener
 
ations before them\, or can they choose who they want to become? At its hea
 
rt\, Descendants reminds us that where a young person comes from does not d
 
etermine where they can go. That idea lives at the center of ICEF Performin
 
g Arts. Through theatre\, music\, dance and technical production\, scholars
 
 are challenged to discover their voices\, develop their talents\, build co
 
mmunity and imagine possibilities for themselves. Tickets & info: https://w
 
ww.ticketmaster.com/icef-performing-arts-presents-disneys-descendents-ingle
 
wood-california-12-04-2026/event/0B006553A0F641F8
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/icef-performing-arts-presents-disneys-desc
 
endents-inglewood-california-12-04-2026/event/0B006553A0F641F8
END:VEVENT
